config.trailsandtalesbackport.hangingSigns.tooltip=Hanging signs for every wood.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.hangingSigns.enabled.tooltip=Hanging signs. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.signs.tooltip=1.20's sign changes: editing, text on both sides and waxing.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.signs.enabled.tooltip=Signs can be edited after placing, carry text on both sides, and can be waxed.
