config.trailsandtalesbackport.structures.enabled.tooltip=Trail ruins and the archaeology added to older structures. Off, none generate.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.sniffer.tooltip=The sniffer, sniffer eggs, torchflowers and pitcher plants.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.sniffer.enabled.tooltip=The sniffer, its egg, torchflowers and pitcher plants. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.sniffer.torchflowerLight.tooltip=Not in Minecraft: torchflowers, planted or potted, give off light level 10. Off, as in Minecraft, they give none. A flower already placed updates when it or a block next to it changes.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.camels.tooltip=Camels.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.camels.enabled.tooltip=Camels. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.smithing.tooltip=Smithing templates and armor trims.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.smithing.enabled.tooltip=Smithing templates and armor trims. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.smithing.netheriteNeedsTemplate.tooltip=Netherite upgrades need the netherite upgrade smithing template, as in 1.20, on whichever smithing table is in the game. Off: an upgrade also works with the template slot left empty.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.smithing.copperOre.tooltip=Copper ore veins in the Overworld for this mod's copy of copper (only without Caves & Cliffs Backport and Tricky Trials Backport, which have their own).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.smithing.geodes.tooltip=Amethyst geodes for this mod's copy of amethyst (only without Caves & Cliffs Backport).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.armadillos.tooltip=The armadillo and armadillo scutes.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.armadillos.enabled.tooltip=The armadillo and armadillo scutes. Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.wolves.tooltip=Wolf armor, the eight new wolf variants and 1.20.5's changes to tamed wolves.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.wolves.enabled.tooltip=Wolf armor, wolf variants and the tamed wolf changes.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.calibratedSculkSensor.tooltip=The calibrated sculk sensor.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.calibratedSculkSensor.enabled.tooltip=The calibrated sculk sensor, the sculk sensor when Wild Update Backport is absent, and 1.20's vibrations (amethyst resonance, the game events of this mod's blocks and mobs). Off, nothing is registered.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.heads.tooltip=The piglin head, and mob heads on note blocks.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.heads.enabled.tooltip=The piglin head and mob heads playing their mob's sound on note blocks.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.compat.tooltip=How this mod behaves alongside other mods.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.compat.duplicates.tooltip=When another installed mod adds the same blocks and items (stripped logs, bamboo, chain): OURS hides the other mod's, THEIRS hides ours, BOTH hides nothing.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.compat.convertRemoved.tooltip=Convert blocks and items left behind by another mod that added them, when that mod is removed from a world.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.presentation1205.tooltip=1.20.5's world warnings and Viossa: chunk failure and low disk space toasts, the low disk space and world recovery screens, and the Viossa language.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.presentation1205.chunkToasts.tooltip=In singleplayer, a toast when a chunk fails to load or save (1.20.5).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.presentation1205.lowDiskSpace.tooltip=A warning screen when opening a singleplayer world with less than 64 MB free, and a toast when the game saves with that little space left (1.20.5).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.presentation1205.recoverWorld.tooltip=Worlds whose level.dat cannot be read show in the world list and open the Failed to Load World screen, which can restore level.dat_old, instead of 1.12.2 using level.dat_old silently (1.20.5).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.presentation1205.viossa.tooltip=Viossa in the language list (1.20.5).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.misc.tooltip=1.20's smaller changes to existing blocks, items and mobs.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.misc.effectParticles.tooltip=1.20.5's effect particles: one particle per effect in its own color (ambient ones fainter), and fewer of them, in place of one blended color. Shown while 1.20.5 or later is the newest installed version. Client only.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.misc.enabled.tooltip=1.20's smaller changes to existing blocks, items and mobs.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.misc.deathMessages.tooltip=1.20's death messages: /kill reads "was killed" and the world border "left the confines of this world".
config.trailsandtalesbackport.misc.stepSounds.tooltip=1.20's step sounds: walking on a carpet, moss carpet, snow layer or roots plays it and, muffled, the block below; on petals, a lily pad or glow lichen it plays that block.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.tooltip=1.20's changes to how mobs fight, shields block and the spawn area stays loaded, and smaller 1.20 rules.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.meleeReach.tooltip=1.20.2's mob melee reach: a mob hits only what its own box, widened by 0.83 blocks to each side (not up or down), touches, and only what it can see. No hits through thin walls or from below a mounted rider; tall mobs like endermen reach higher. Applies to every melee AI built on vanilla's.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.shieldPitch.tooltip=1.20.3: a raised shield blocks by the way the player faces, whatever the pitch, so it also blocks while looking straight up or down.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.spawnChunks.tooltip=1.20.5's spawn chunks: the area kept loaded around the world spawn is 5 by 5 chunks (radius 2) instead of 1.12.2's 17 by 17, and the game prepares only that area when a world starts.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.redyeing.tooltip=1.20: beds, wool and carpets of any color can be dyed another color in the crafting grid (1.12.2: only white ones).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.slimeJumpBoost.tooltip=1.20: Jump Boost makes slimes and magma cubes jump higher.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.chorusFallDistance.tooltip=1.20: teleporting by eating chorus fruit resets fall distance, so the landing does no fall damage built up before.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.arrowNames.tooltip=1.20.3: an arrow item with a custom name shot from a bow keeps the name, and picking the arrow up gives the named item back.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.enchantingGaps.tooltip=1.20: bookshelves power an enchanting table through grass, snow layers, vines, fire, water and other replaceable blocks (1.12.2: only through air), and each shelf needs only the one block between it and the table clear.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.blockSounds.tooltip=1.20.2 and 1.20.5's block sounds: jukeboxes and tripwire hooks sound like wood, levers, repeaters and comparators like stone; sponges, wet sponges and cobwebs have their own sounds, and a sponge makes a sound when it soaks up water.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.batModel.tooltip=1.20.3's bat: its new model, texture and animations.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.hopperPickup.tooltip=1.20.5: a hopper with a full block on top no longer picks up items lying on that block (it still takes from a container there).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.pearlSound.tooltip=1.20.3: a player's thrown ender pearl plays a teleport sound where it lands.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.entityNames.tooltip=1.20.3: the custom name of an entity that is not a mob, such as a minecart or a boat, shows while you look at it.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.gameRules.tooltip=1.20.2 to 1.20.5's game rules: enderPearlsVanishOnDeath, projectilesCanBreakBlocks, playersNetherPortalDefaultDelay, playersNetherPortalCreativeDelay and spawnChunkRadius; and randomTickSpeed also sets how fast snow and ice form and cauldrons fill in the rain (0 stops them).
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.barrierParticles.tooltip=1.20.2: landing on a barrier makes no particles.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.mechanics.witherColor.tooltip=1.20: Wither's particles are the lighter gray-brown of 1.20.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.lookAndFeel.tooltip=1.20's look: the cherry grove panorama, the title logo, splashes, menu music and the rest.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.lookAndFeel.enabled.tooltip=1.20's title screen, splashes, menu music, options and loading screen through Backport Core.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.lookAndFeel.gameMusic.tooltip=1.20 adds A Familiar Room to the music that plays in every overworld biome.
config.trailsandtalesbackport.lookAndFeel.biomeMusic.tooltip=1.20's biome music: Bromeliad, Crescent Dunes, Echo in the Wind and the older tracks in jungles, deserts, badlands, forests, old growth taigas and the cherry grove, and 1.20's lists in Caves & Cliffs' 1.18 biomes.
